      <li><a href="#daylight-saving-time-bst">3. British Summer Time (BST) & DST Rules</a></li>
      <li><a href="#uk-overseas-territories">4. UK Overseas Territories & Crown Dependencies</a></li>
      <li><a href="#regional-variations-uk">5. Regional Solar Variations (England, Scotland, Wales, NI)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#uk-vs-world-comparison">6. UK vs World Time Zone Comparison Table</a></li>
      <li><a href="#working-across-timezones">7. Scheduling & Business Between UK, US, and Global Markets</a></li>
      <li><a href="#developer-guide-uk">8. Developer Guide: Handling UK Time Zones & IANA Rules</a></li>
